  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(5)/(4)+((1)/(1+frac{5){7}})-(3)/(5) \n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nFor fractions: a/b ÷ c/d = (a × d) / (b × c)\n\nFor subtraction: a/b - c/d = (ad - bc) / bd\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(5)/(4)+((1)/(1+frac{5){7}})-(3)/(5) \n\n⇒ (5)/(4)+((1)/(frac{12){7}})-(3)/(5) \n\n⇒ (5)/(4)+((7)/(12))-(3)/(5) \n\n⇒ (75 + 35 - 36)/(60)\n\n⇒ (74)/(60)\n\n \n\n⇒ 37/30\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 37/30.**",
